    "chunk_size_bytes": 647,
    "chunk_text": "The Association further claimed that it had received information indicating that the Governor had communicated with certain authorities, including members of the Government, seeking their intervention in relation to the matter.\n\nThe letter stressed that even the perception of interference in judicial affairs was a matter of serious concern and urged the President, as Head of State, to ensure that there is \u201czero tolerance\u201d for any attempt to influence the functioning of the courts.\n\nThe Association has requested an opportunity to meet President Dissanayake in person to discuss the matter further and expressed hope for an early response."
